                ("p", "Start with the documents. Using the number plate, you can request the **[[informe-dgt|DGT vehicle report]]** (from the Spanish traffic authority), which shows the registered keeper, any charges or liens, the [[itv|ITV (MOT)]] history and the mileage recorded at inspections. If the mileage does not match the odometer, be wary."),
