                ("p", "If you can, ask a workshop you trust to inspect the bodywork before buying. A [[medidor-de-espesores|paint thickness gauge]] picks up resprayed or filled panels, and a look at the underbody and inner joints shows whether the car has had a structural impact. We do this in our [pre-purchase inspection](revision-antes-de-comprar.html), with a report and photos."),
