                ("p", "If you buy from a **dealer or professional seller**, Spanish law gives you a legal guarantee which, for second-hand goods, may be set at no less than **one year**. It covers lack of conformity, meaning faults the car already had or features that do not match the advert. Always ask for an invoice and the warranty terms in writing."),
                ("p", "If you buy from a **private seller**, there is no such guarantee, although you may be able to claim for serious hidden defects within certain time limits. That makes an inspection before buying even more important."),
